{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-16_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-16","title":"睜眼，便是日暮","storyCode":"JT8-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-16_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9a7246b6f38ca3850b39940777e82e30996d3935a267f413b03daf9586d0b2e7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_40"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"喝——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別想碰她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你要護著她嗎，暉潔，護著這個感染者的叛徒，我們同胞的劊子手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我很失望，暉潔。你讓我太失望了，不僅對我刀劍相向....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？！你怎麼在這......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，阿米婭！塔露拉她確實繼承了科西切的一切。她已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已經不是什麼被從龍門綁架走的無辜失蹤女孩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官。不對。她不只是“繼承人”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會戳破它的偽裝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？什麼......偽裝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你是羅德島的那隻卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替呢？你們是試過了他鋒利的戟，還是看到了他遭撕扯的屍骨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎麼會用這種口氣說他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我充滿敬意地向你詢問這個問題。我只是在質詢事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他直到最後也沒有摘下過頭盔，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他的頭盔掩藏了他們溫迪戈裸露在外的灰白色頭骨。如果市民們直視了他的真實相貌，一定連手中的石塊都拿不穩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但仇恨和狂熱還是會驅使著他們，混在人群中的武器會衝破遊擊隊的防線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替不會允許盾衛攻擊任何一個市民......他們的確是市民而非奸細。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替本會被暴民撕碎。他也會任由狂怒與無知將他分解，如同他知曉這一天會來，卻最終向他的人性投降放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你出現在這裡，就只有一個可能性，博卓卡斯替死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，他是接受了哪一種死法？偉大的戰士。我想知道他的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我殺害了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......你擁有多少武裝力量？那可是......博卓卡斯替。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你卻孤身來見我，和我可憐的妹妹一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。這城中最後一個能殺我的人都死了。那麼現在，這座城市裡，已經沒有需要我擔憂的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我該嘉獎你嗎，屠殺我同胞的感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，不要中她的計！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經和我玩了很多這種花樣了......她的話我只建議你一個字也別當真。哪怕她......說的是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，陳長官。她想殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們面前的塔露拉心底還有一部分沒被根除的記憶脈絡，你是她與過去唯一的象徵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在......咦。你在說些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——你想看到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你攔不住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"否則她為什麼......單單是想引誘你來和她交戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只有她親手殺了你，塔露拉才會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我開始聽不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，陳長官，現在你面前的塔露拉還沒有完全死去。這個暴君還沒法完全掌控她的心智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看，卡特斯。即使你那已經過時的把戲在任何人看來都是荒誕無比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在塔露拉刺死你的時候，你就已經該死了。這片大地已經沒有你的容身之處了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"讀心兔子......我可沒想過這個。即使你能讀心，你也不該知道這個。你從哪裡聽來的傳聞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在讀心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直自誇能夠從精神的源石技藝裡完整地保護自己，科西切公爵。你以此為驕傲，你的政敵奈何不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見的只是記憶。你現在心裡想的那些我一點也不清楚，但我感受得到你的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你的記憶裡窺見了秘密，我看見那個魔咒至今纏繞在你的身軀之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"下定論前先保住自己的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！別愣著，躲開那火！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然......你竟然能擋住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......但......也擋不了太長時間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你也很驚訝，不是嗎？呵，之前她就擋下過一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"與切爾諾伯格時別無二致的黑色線條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你能抵擋多久呢？你的戰士倒下了，他們的犧牲就換來你今天無謂的投火而死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，你還能邊施術邊窺伺他人的思想嗎？如此齷齪的伎倆，我只想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"想到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以仔細想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟哪個才是你的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......博卓卡斯替死在你手裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，剩下的火我會切開！收手，向右邊跳！能跳多遠跳多遠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......謝謝你，陳長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，阿米婭，塔露拉似乎......對你感到很驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，不如說，接下來不管發生什麼事，你都不要因為太驚訝而放鬆警惕就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我盡力。我不覺得有什麼事情能比你我的生命更重要，能比之後龍門的命運更讓人吃驚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你......被叫做阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，如果我邀請你為我製造一段能夠令我永遠癡迷其中的幻覺......你會拒絕我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你會忍住不去使用這種力量嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情和猶豫出賣了你的想法，自詡心地善良的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有這麼說過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的作為已經這麼說了，虛偽的感染者戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色的法術，汲取記憶而非識取意識，不是單向的遞解而是雙向的播撒與收獲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能啊......怎麼可能啊？卡特斯，怎麼回事？你能回答我嗎？卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲是不是都已經瘋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——魔族——薩卡茲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然有一個異族的王？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"上一任魔王是瘋子還是狂人？我都已經記不起它的名字，只是這樣看來薩卡茲的確離亡族不遠矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，薩卡茲的雇傭兵......W。他們背後的薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是這樣。原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯的魔王啊。哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米婭，說實在的，我不是驚訝......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（我是感到有些茫然。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（你相信她說的話嗎，陳長官？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（我相信她說的那些有什麼用嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（我相信選擇權在你，陳長官。並且，是的，這些事實也不能讓你改變你的看法。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（對。何況我覺得她是在拖時間，想拖到我們都被憋死。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（但我們也是在拖時間......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你的副手在哪裡？你王庭的眾王與臣民又在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你還帶了誰來，是那個身體腐朽了幾個世紀的食屍鬼，還是那個見不得一絲光的老紅眼病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你親手懲罰了博卓卡斯替，還是說有人替你做了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能，年幼的、假造的魔王，你做不到，你驅策不了它們和它們的王庭。你不是真正的魔王，你連薩卡茲都不是。你只是一隻卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你無力與你的敵人抗衡，如果你們真要開始爭鬥，那你將被迅速地毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你就是薩卡茲統治者們的一個新玩具而已。你有為你試驗品的身份而感到傷心嗎，稚嫩的卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你是異族，你只能乖乖等著別人取走你的性命和君王的象徵。你的生命隨之散逸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事我可以代勞。我會讓你儘量沒有痛苦地從這片土地上消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不死的黑蛇......你在害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你說了很多，科西切公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，要是你的命真有傳說裡那麼長的話，要是你偶爾流露出的畏縮不是你的表演的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算是已經懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切？！阿米婭，你說的是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在你面前的，既是塔露拉，也是科西切。我的感覺不會錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你在過去和薩卡茲交戰過吧，科西切公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你害怕我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你在害怕我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，玩笑已經夠多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要點時間去梳理下現行戲目的邏輯，其精彩程度令人驚歎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"在此之前就只能請你先退場了，卡特斯。我從沒想過你會發揮這麼大的作用，我低估了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果能體驗到我的“畏懼”，那麼，只怕你的法術還太幼稚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——我想感受到什麼，我就會感受到什麼。我也許沒法掩蓋記憶，但感情同樣是我擅長的領域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說的是真的。所以，這更堅定了我的想法。現在的你，絕對還不完全是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我給你一些時間，讓你再從我腦海中挖掘出什麼真相嗎？可我的過去就是那樣，也只是那樣。你什麼都證明不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我對思緒的掌控力能讓那些妄圖揣摩我想法的人無功而返，但你卻看不見我想給你看的東西，你很誠實，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有說謊。你只是能感受情緒，回溯記憶，你看不到我實際的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我告誡你，卡特斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不認識我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不認識“塔露拉”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你所說的一切，都只建立在你的推測上。你根本不懂我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉。或者說，科西切......我不管你是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是誰，不，不對，你就是塔露拉。是科西切造就了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你連她一根頭髮都碰不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"為了外人而對自己的親人刀劍相向，暉潔，你可真是英勇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"無論我身邊站的是誰，塔露拉，一個善良的人是不會想利用我身邊的人去擊倒我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔，你沒有見過烏薩斯的北原。你就像在農場裡培育出的觀賞花一樣，你見識過的慘禍太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道是什麼把我變成了現在這副樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"當然！我想知道......我怎麼會不想知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道發生在你身邊的一切。我想聽你親口對我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......為什麼不到我的身邊來呢？現在，陳......我不想再和你戰鬥，不想再傷害你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你搞錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——我想知道，是因為我想阻止這些事情再一次發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，是因為我要判斷你的行為，揣摩你的動機，比照你的案例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想知道，是因為我要認清你現在要做什麼，要怎麼做，要做到什麼地步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，是因為我要看清有多少罪惡捲入其中！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經這麼做了，塔露拉，不管我願不願意，你已經成長了，長成了現在的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是，暉潔。你長成了讓我傷心的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我的所作所為讓你心痛？整合運動侵害我的城市，殺死我的朋友，害死無數烏薩斯人民，葬送了那麼多感染者......誰讓誰心痛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著那些整合運動在龍門相互幫助，為了同胞的生命甘願犧牲，他們走向了荒野也無處容身，是誰讓誰心痛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你是他們的敵人。是你阻撓了我的同胞們，讓他們沒能奪下龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，塔露拉，如果說你不是為了現在這一刻而讓他們在龍門送命的話，我是不相信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你就沒有相信過我，暉潔。你根本不相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你說我認不認識塔露拉，我認識。你說我相不相信塔露拉，我當然相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，為了驗證這個想法而來到你面前，我是自願的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我來這裡，不是為了來證明你的清白......不，絕對不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？你不是剛說你信任我嗎，暉潔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們已經都是感染者了，為什麼我們還不能站在一起？我們的重逢不應該是件令人開心的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的思緒竟然真的在顫動......呃......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別扯開話題，整合運動的領袖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要證據，判斷，以及證實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的近衛局的我，現在的陳暉潔......我不是要證明“你是清白的”，不對，怎麼可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的塔露拉？我沒聽錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是什麼鑄就了我面前現在的你，塔露拉什麼時候能被拆成兩半看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因為我過去認識你，所以我才更要弄明白......是誰把你變成這樣，是什麼把你變成這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你遭受的痛苦和折磨，你父親死亡的真相，你對魏彥吾的痛恨，我都可以想像。可能這些東西把你逼上了這條道路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但又是什麼，又是什麼會讓你變成一個對同胞和對敵人都同樣刻薄的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼讓你變成了烏薩斯侵略的先鋒？你是不是也欺騙了你的同僚，塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你要審判我？你拋棄了你的一切到這裡來，只是要和我決裂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"是魏彥吾把你變成了這樣一個冷血無情又盲目的人嗎？你該問的，不是為什麼我要這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不。這些等到這之後再說。我有能力從廢品堆裡重新拼出事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我來，是來履行我的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是的確沒做這些，我會把信號彈發射上天。即使你殺了我也沒所謂，我還是能證明你罪不至死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是還打算實施些什麼害人的陰謀，那我們會不顧一切地阻止你，哪怕我們都會在此喪命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我是要看你到底錯到什麼程度。不經審判就奪走生命？那是謀殺。那是城市對感染者犯下的罪行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我已經看清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我的劍，我的想法，我的觀念，都是留給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"至於過去的一切，就讓它留在過去吧。過去的一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"都不會再回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一個草菅人命的陰謀家，不管這個陰謀家是誰，我的劍都不會留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能逍遙法外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你想與我斷絕關係，暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再嘲諷我也沒意義，你想讓我產生什麼負疚感之類的，也隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經是現在這副樣子了，我說過的，我就會做到。忘了這些的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我不問你還要準備些什麼了。我只問你，你要我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，陳長官......我需要一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"最多多少時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"三分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那我最少給你三分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這次是真正的“並肩作戰”了，阿米婭。只有我們兩個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我們背著無數性命，你我都清楚得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"三分鐘裡，阿米婭，這三分鐘裡，你一定不會死。我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，除了我們奮鬥的目標以外，我希望你最後給我個交待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你得幫我，和我一起搞明白我的姐妹究竟變成了什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我想知道，我們最後是不是真的有機會去面對這個人的本質，而不是一具表演欲特別強的皮囊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是什麼結果，我都接受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我答應你，陳長官。還有謝謝你......謝謝你的堅持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"眼見為實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你做的這些，你的言行......我都看在眼裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你，陳長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯人，我不知道你是用什麼干擾了我妹妹的思維，也不知道你和薩卡茲有什麼骯髒的交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"在你背後操控你的陰影與W背後的主使者，是不是同一人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不必回答。先得用火焰告訴你......你不該依附薩卡茲，也不該運用它們的力量去羞辱我和我妹妹之間的聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"齷齪的行徑與罪惡的過往，這些都可以被接受，你的國家依然會以寬大的懷抱接納你的一切和你的懺悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，與眾多薩卡茲為伍，與卡茲戴爾沆瀣一氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......培養你的人和你都該被永世流放，你們將在荒野上徘徊，口渴卻不得水，饑餓卻不得食，想活下去卻被食腐蟲啃噬，想死卻無安息之日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是塔露拉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔，如果你想知道真相，就不要再保護你身邊那顆惡毒的種子了，她挑撥我們之間的關係，歪曲事實，利用我的記憶去迷惑你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯人，你！博卓卡斯替追尋光明離開了魔窟，而你卻走向黑暗......你不配殺他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你口中的魔族是我認識的薩卡茲人，如果你說的人類是你這種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你說的光明是屠殺、撒播痛苦、施加傷害與欺騙，而你說的黑暗是救助、悲憫與為公義而奮鬥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我甘願和薩卡茲一同走下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是感染者的身份蒙蔽了你？是薩卡茲對感染者的利用讓你錯認了他們的目的嗎？你難道不清楚，你才是那個被利用的棋子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣你還想勸誘我的妹妹，讓她跌入深淵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我的火焰會燒盡虛假，揭示出你背後的真相。當心，這會有點疼。我卻一定要這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你該先問過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想做這種事的，暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"之前你可不是這麼幹的。你的心口不一我已經有點......看夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是你的仇恨讓你盲目，讓你已經看不清自己，逃脫不了你的身份......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"火焰，是你還沒走出那場大火，“塔露拉”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉","塔露拉？"]}]}
